   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accountability Lab SA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In an effort to shift norms and change behaviours around integrity and accountability in South Africa, this project aims to generate constructive conversations around the idea of integrity and accountability by building a network of honest government officials and engaged young people who can actively push for better governance and SDG16.

To achieve these objectives, and in light of the challenges and opportunities imposed on us by the corona virus pandemic, Accountability Lab is proposing the following activities to compliment and build upon the 2020 Integrity Icon South Africa Campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
